text+='<h3>Completed independent single-FFI controls</h3><p>All four full fits met the existing plateau criteria in every stage. Both T4 campaigns have synchronized and stopped; no GPU remains allocated by this task. These are in-sample controls, not a held-source precision certification.</p>'
